  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the yakimono grill to medium high heat",
    "Toss the cauliflower florets with sesame oil, soy sauce, and grated ginger, then grill until charred and tender",
    "Cook the ramen noodles according to package instructions and set aside",
    "In a large pot, combine the vegetable broth and miso paste, whisking until smooth",
    "Bring the broth to a simmer and cook for 5 minutes",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the pot and cook for an additional 2 minutes",
    "To serve, place the noodles and broth in a bowl, then top with charred cauliflower and green onions"
